  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup peanut butter",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 egg"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients, preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line baking sheets with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nLsdNItVA-w5g-OzG5XXJ2xLAAQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11352-three-ingredient-peanut-butter-cookie-step1-4x3-0135064414802194-3a88777331404a8ebc201d5b5b65bfd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11352/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix peanut butter, white sugar, and egg in a medium bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EkENtaMWm3gBIeaDr9QUaAtsLKg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11352-three-ingredient-peanut-butter-cookie-step2-4x3-0135064414802194-a8d5ed463e9a47468a1fd0c87705a3cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11352/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll mixture into 1-inch balls and place 1 inch apart on an ungreased baking sheet; flatten each with a fork, making a criss-cross pattern.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PXItXuus92KrzGveGSYXhGaTvWc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11352-three-ingredient-peanut-butter-cookie-step4-4x3-0135064414802204-5f9c68f3b07d467090ae3be95a2f939b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11352/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cookies are just barely brown on the bottoms, about 6 to 8 minutes. They can become too crumbly if they are overcooked. Cool on the baking sheets briefly before removing to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ov-m0MLmlSC96eIfxze_Y9J6RUY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11352-three-ingredient-peanut-butter-cookie-step6-4x3-0135064414802207-f2a523136936450db8ac26c4d0865275.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11352/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
